      <title>Geely To Buy 30% Stake in Rival Nio’s Battery-Swapping Unit</title>
      <link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-09-28/geely-to-buy-30-stake-in-rival-nio-s-battery-swapping-unit</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">716321b9886cc7b4668fc32d</guid>
      <pubDate>Mon, 28 Sep 2026 00:24:28 +0000</pubDate>
      <description>Zhejiang Geely Holding Group Co. will buy a 30% stake in rival automaker Nio Inc.’s battery-swapping unit, gaining access to China’s largest network of swapping stations in a deal that values the business at about $2.4 billion.</description>
